 {
  "source": "Deutsche Bank",
  "title": "Open-source AI 101: the battle for the future of AI",
  "type": "strategy",
  "priority": "medium",
  "published": "2026-07-21",
  "insights": [
   "The emergence of high-performing open-weight AI models is challenging the business models of proprietary AI providers and hyperscalers by offering 'good enough' alternatives at a fraction of the cost.",
   "Hyperscaler capital expenditure is under scrutiny as open models demonstrate that massive compute investment may not be the only path to competitive AI performance.",
